<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns first credit at 25.21 pct.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns first credit at 25.21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the first of four credits to inject 5.913 billion pesos in the secondary market on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     MAX    MIN     AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.637  bln pesos  17 days  25.35  25.10   25.21    12   4</p>
<p>1.638  bln pesos  14 days</p>
<p>1.638  bln pesos  11 days</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos   1 day</p>
<p>NOTE: Maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
